# Template for LOCAL terminal use only (local tvly-cli testing, manual checks).
# Copy this to ".env" (already excluded by .gitignore) and put the real key there —
# never commit a real ".env" file.
#
# WARNING — this file does NOT feed the scheduled routine (daily/weekly): Claude
# Code Cloud Environments clone the repo fresh on every session, so a .env file,
# even gitignored, never reaches the runner. For the scheduled routine, set
# TAVILY_API_KEY directly in the "Environment variables" field of the
# Environment's edit dialog at claude.ai/code (.env format, one KEY=value line)
# — NOT in a repo file. See AGENTS.md -> Tooling.
#
# Note: tvly search / tvly extract work even WITHOUT a key, under a fair-use
# cap — the key raises the limit and unlocks crawl/map/research.

TAVILY_API_KEY=
